<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
  <head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Document</title><style>@page{size:8.5in 11in;margin:0.75in;} body{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:11pt;color:#111;} h1,h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;} li{margin-bottom:4pt;}</style></head>
  <body><h1 style="text-align:left;letter-spacing:2pt;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:22pt;margin-bottom:2pt;">Anna Williams</h1>
  <p style="text-align:left;font-size:10pt;color:#444;margin-top:0;">(555) 555-5555 | hello@youremail.com | City, State | linkedin.com/in/yourname</p>
  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #999;"><h2 style="background:#E3EEEE;color:#2A6B6E;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5pt;padding:6pt;font-size:12pt;margin:16pt 0 8pt;">Professional Summary</h2><ul><li>Write a 2–3 sentence summary of your qualifications: years of healthcare experience, your clinical or administrative specialty, and a top achievement.</li><li>Mention your licenses/credentials, the scope of care, staff, or budget you've overseen, and the qualities that make you the right fit for this role.</li></ul><p style="text-align:center;">Patient / Client Care Coordination - EMR / EHR Documentation - Regulatory &amp; HIPAA Compliance - Cross-Functional Team Leadership - Budget &amp; Resource Management - Quality Improvement Initiatives - Staff Training &amp; Development - Critical Thinking &amp; Problem Solving</p><h2 style="background:#E3EEEE;color:#2A6B6E;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5pt;padding:6pt;font-size:12pt;margin:16pt 0 8pt;">Experience</h2><p style="margin:8pt 0 0;"><b>// PROFESSIONAL TITLE</b><span style="float:right;font-weight:bold;">YEAR – YEAR</span></p><div style="clear:both;"></div><p style="font-style:italic;margin:0 0 4pt;">Company / Facility Name, City, Province, Country</p><p style="margin:0 0 4pt;">A brief job and organization description. Highlight your achievements at the company instead of simply listing your tasks. Show real examples.</p><ul><li>Give numbers and statistical examples if you can of how you have impacted the organization while you were working there.</li><li>An example of this would be — improved patient/client satisfaction scores by 40% by introducing new coordination techniques.</li><li>Always highlight your most quantifiable accomplishments first. Do this before listing your responsibilities and your working tasks.</li></ul><p style="margin:8pt 0 0;"><b>// PROFESSIONAL TITLE</b><span style="float:right;font-weight:bold;">YEAR – YEAR</span></p><div style="clear:both;"></div><p style="font-style:italic;margin:0 0 4pt;">Company / Facility Name, City, Province, Country</p><p style="margin:0 0 4pt;">A brief job and organization description. Highlight your achievements at the company instead of simply listing your tasks. Show real examples.</p><ul><li>Give numbers and statistical examples if you can of how you have impacted the organization while you were working there.</li><li>An example of this would be — reduced patient/client wait times by 25% by redesigning intake and scheduling workflow.</li><li>Always highlight your most quantifiable accomplishments first. Do this before listing your responsibilities and your working tasks.</li></ul><p style="margin:8pt 0 0;"><b>// PROFESSIONAL TITLE</b><span style="float:right;font-weight:bold;">YEAR – YEAR</span></p><div style="clear:both;"></div><p style="font-style:italic;margin:0 0 4pt;">Company / Facility Name, City, Province, Country</p><p style="margin:0 0 4pt;">A brief job and organization description. Highlight your achievements at the company instead of simply listing your tasks. Show real examples.</p><ul><li>Give numbers and statistical examples if you can of how you have impacted the organization while you were working there.</li><li>An example of this would be — improvement of monthly/yearly outcomes or efficiency increased by 40% by introducing new protocols.</li><li>Tailor every resume to every job listing and organization.</li></ul><h2 style="background:#E3EEEE;color:#2A6B6E;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5pt;padding:6pt;font-size:12pt;margin:16pt 0 8pt;">Education &amp; Certifications</h2><p style="margin:8pt 0 0;"><b>DEGREE OR CERTIFICATION TITLE / University / College Name</b><span style="float:right;font-weight:bold;">YEAR–YEAR</span></p><div style="clear:both;"></div><p style="margin:8pt 0 0;"><b>DEGREE OR CERTIFICATION TITLE / University / College Name</b><span style="float:right;font-weight:bold;">YEAR–YEAR</span></p><div style="clear:both;"></div><h2 style="background:#E3EEEE;color:#2A6B6E;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5pt;padding:6pt;font-size:12pt;margin:16pt 0 8pt;">Awards &amp; Honors</h2><ul><li>// AWARD NAME — Organization / School Name, City, Province, Country, YEAR</li><li>// AWARD NAME — Organization / School Name, City, Province, Country, YEAR</li></ul><h2 style="background:#E3EEEE;color:#2A6B6E;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5pt;padding:6pt;font-size:12pt;margin:16pt 0 8pt;">Licenses &amp; Certifications</h2><ul><li>License / Credential Type: [e.g. RN, MD, DO, PA, LPN, NP, LCSW]  |  Licensing State/Body  |  License Expiration: 01/01/2020  |  License Number: 1212 12 12 12</li><li>Certification Name  |  Issuing Organization  |  Licensing State/Body  |  License Expiration: 01/01/2020  |  License Number: 1212 12 12 12</li><li>Certification Name  |  Issuing Organization  |  City, State, Country  |  Date: 02/02/2020</li></ul><h2 style="background:#E3EEEE;color:#2A6B6E;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5pt;padding:6pt;font-size:12pt;margin:16pt 0 8pt;">Professional Development</h2><ul><li>// EXTRA COURSE, CLASS, WORKSHOP, CONVENTION, STUDIES — School/Organization Name, City, Province, Country, YEAR</li><li>Write a summary about your extra classes, workshops, courses, etc. State how it applies to the objectives of the position in which you are applying.</li></ul></body></html>